{"id":"vod_bf_8360","vodId":"8360","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"盾之勇者成名录第二季","name_cn":"盾之勇者成名录第二季","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-9/161bca6606156ee9876db8c276fabb7f.jpg"},"summary":"普普通通的大学生——岩谷尚文受到召唤来到异世界，成为了四圣勇者之一——“盾之勇者”。尽管蒙受不白之冤，多次遭到迫害，他依旧和拉芙塔莉雅、菲洛和梅尔蒂这几个好伙伴齐心协力，从威胁世界的灾厄“浪潮”中保护着人们。在自身的努力和梅洛马格女王的帮助下，尚文恢复了名誉，获得了自己的领地，并为应对即将再次袭来的浪潮进行着准备。然而，在梅洛马格东方的灵龟国，能带来前所未有灾难的魔物——灵龟复活了。尚文接受了女王讨伐灵龟的委托，一行人带上新加入的队友莉西亚前往灵龟国。在联军陆续集结之时，灵龟国国王侧室——奥斯特·蓬莱摄政王妃出现在了尚文面前。尚文从她口中得知，灵龟是被人以非常规方式复活的。他们究竟能否讨伐灵龟，揪出幕后黑手呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:29:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/dunzhiyongzhechengmingludierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/